Z||000010||zeusrekning||11-28-2000||07:51 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by PearlBlueSoul:<BR><B>Hey!  just wanted to say wassup n all.  No hard feelings n stuff, cuz we all are a tad biased towards our respective cars.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  hehe. I know I sure am.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>tell you what bud I'm about 30 miles north of Greenwood SC.<BR>If you come up i'll let you drive my fiero<P>and help you find a nice one.<BR>oh yeah i'm Tim (one of the founding members of the CFA) <A HREF="http://www.carolinafieros.com" TARGET=_blank>www.carolinafieros.com</A> <P><BR>||||reg||1
Z||000011||Cheever2||11-28-2000||09:00 PM||||Tell ya one thing, PBS, you make a fine representative for your people.<P>I know absolutely nothing about MR2's, and have never been inside one. I do like how they look.  But I have <B>five questions</B>:<BR>1-can big guys fit in them (guess you saw our topic on that about Fieros)?<BR>2-are the gauges in English?<BR>3-does the speedo have MPH as well as KPH?<BR>4-has the owners manual been translated badly?<BR>5(most important)-do they have cupholders?<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000012||Raydar||11-28-2000||11:54 PM||||PearlBlue,<BR>Welcome! And yes, that is one sweeeet looking MR2. <BR>I drove an MR2 when they were first released. Almost bought it. To me, the handling was similar to a Lotus Europa that a friend of mine had. Cornered like a slot car. <BR>I finally ended up buying an 85 Fiero GT. The looks, the sound, and the plastic body are what sold me. <BR>The handling is why I ended up selling it.<BR>(Wish I would have known some of the alignment tricks that I've heard of, here. Wish NTW would have known...)<BR>Oh yeah. Deal's Gap.<BR>There is an annual event that some of the Southeastern Fiero clubs take turns sponsoring, called "Run For The Hills".<BR>The most recent one (October) was run through Deal's Gap, I believe. Unfortunately, I missed it, due to work constraints. <BR>Heard it was an absolute blast. <P>Raydar<p>[This message has been edited by Raydar (edited 11-28-2000).]||||reg||14
